Package: bgbcalc
Type: Package
Title: Calculations for German Civil Code Rules (BGB-Rechenregeln)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "riskdatascience@web.de", comment = "Dr."),
    person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = c("aut", "cph")))
Description: Native numerical and calendar calculations for provisions of the
    German Civil Code (Buergerliches Gesetzbuch, BGB). German parameter names
    preserve statutory terminology (deutsche Rechtsbegriffe). Results include
    exact fractions (Brueche), calculation steps (Rechenschritte), assumptions
    (Annahmen), and a fixed source identifier (Quellenfassung). Legal conditions
    require qualified inputs. Conditional models require justified method choices (Methodenwahl); universal
    legal completeness is not asserted (keine umfassende Rechtsentscheidung).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: de
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils, stats
Suggests: jsonlite
URL: https://github.com/rds0001/bgbcalc-r
